+/*
+ * 0192 (guacamole 0150/0157, present at swap): wake the present thread (0175) at the swap instead of at the next
+ * vsync tick. The panel (command mode, autorefresh) scans out on its own clock anyway; waiting for our software
+ * tick added up to one period of latency and, for a frame that just missed a tick, a whole extra period. The
+ * thread still serializes presents and always takes the latest frame. Boot-arg sweetfbatswap=1 turns it on
+ * (default off until it is measured on the phone). Counted as "at swap" in the 5 s gaps line.
+ */
+static bool sweet_fb_at_swap;
